  "changes": "Original movement/lifecycle retained. Hydra includes, flags, merged headers and draw buffers adapted to Three. Newborn nodes are initialized along the input direction using Three Line3. The original previous-segment fallback also handles coincident nodes; only a wholly collapsed chain is clipped. Tube cross-sections use Three Curve.computeFrenetFrames parallel transport instead of the unstable radial basis. Dormant chains clipped before normalizing; negative fractional powers guarded; non-finite fragments discarded and HDR output bounded to 64 for half-float bloom buffers. Local input only; blue/violet colors.",
